{"symbol":"KASTURI","yahoo":"KASTURI.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Kasturi Metal Composite Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","website":"https://www.steelfiberindia.in","about":"Kasturi Metal Composite Limited manufactures and sells steel fiber and steel wool fibers for the infrastructure, industrial flooring, and engineered construction segments in India and internationally. The company offers crimped steel fibers, flat/loose and glued hook-end steel fibers, steel wool fibers, polypropylene macro synthetic fibers, delta loop end steel fibers, stainless steel fibers, and sigma series micro steel fibers under the Duraflex, Durabond, and Durocrete brands. It also provides flooring solutions. The company's products are used in tunnel shotcrete, precast concrete, friction linings, industrial and warehouse flooring, roads and pavements, mining, and ultra-high-performance concrete applications, as well as for tunnels, precast structures, refractory applications, UHPC, brake pads, commercial clutches, heavy machinery, electric vehicle friction systems, environments with chemical exposure or corrosion, and weight-limited structures. It exports its products to Nepal, Bhutan, Dubai, and New Zealand. Kasturi Metal Composite Limited was incorporated in 2005 and is based in Amravati, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:34:03+00:00","quote":{"price":64.0,"prevClose":59.36,"marketCap":66.53,"high52":73.8,"low52":44.2,"pe":13.22,"bookValue":35.64,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":15.92,"shares":1.0395,"insiders":91.26,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2026-02-03","2026-02-04","2026-02-05","2026-02-06","2026-02-09","2026-02-10","2026-02-11","2026-02-12","2026-02-13","2026-02-16","2026-02-17","2026-02-18","2026-02-19","2026-02-20","2026-02-23","2026-02-24","2026-02-25","2026-02-26","2026-02-27","2026-03-02","2026-03-04","2026-03-05","2026-03-06","2026-03-09","2026-03-10","2026-03-11","2026-03-12","2026-03-13","2026-03-16","2026-03-17","2026-03-18","2026-03-19","202